🧩 1. FULL ENGINE PSEUDOCODE
This is the runtime. The “world.” The loop where everything lives.
engine CMB_Engine:

    init():
        load(pattern_detectors)
        load(compressors)
        load(predictors)
        load(adapters)
        load(evolution_rules)
        load(organisms)
        load(world_state)

    step(input):
        patterns = detect(input, world_state)
        compressed = compress(patterns)
        predictions = predict(compressed, world_state)
        behaviors = adapt(predictions, organisms)
        evolved = evolve(organisms, behaviors, world_state)
        world_state = update(world_state, behaviors)
        return world_state, evolved

    run(stream):
        for frame in stream:
            step(frame)
This is your detect → compress → predict → adapt → evolve loop made literal.

